                            </div>
                            <div class="card-body p-4">
                                <p class="fs-5"><strong>Sealed</strong> is like saying "I'm the last one - no more children after me!"</p>

                                <div class="row">
                                    <div class="col-lg-6">
                                        <div class="card bg-light h-100">
                                            <div class="card-body">
                                                <h5><i class="fas fa-code text-primary me-2"></i>🔒 Sealed Class</h5>
                                                <div class="code-block small">
                                                    <pre><code class="language-csharp"><span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="keyword">sealed</span> <span class="keyword">class</span> <span class="class">FinalClass</span>
{
    <span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="keyword">string</span> Data;
}

<span class="comment">// ❌ This will NOT work:</span>
<span class="comment">// public class Child : FinalClass { }  // ERROR!</span></code></pre>
                                                </div>
                                                <p><span class="badge bg-danger">❌</span> Cannot inherit from a sealed class</p>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-lg-6">
                                        <div class="card bg-light h-100">
                                            <div class="card-body">
                                                <h5><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-success me-2"></i>✅ When to Use Sealed</h5>
                                                <ul>
                                                    <li>✅ <strong>Security</strong> - Don't want anyone changing your code</li>
                                                    <li>✅ <strong>Performance</strong> - Slightly faster</li>
                                                    <li>✅ <strong>Design</strong> - Class is perfect as-is</li>
                                                </ul>
                                                <div class="alert alert-info mt-2">
                                                    <i class="fas fa-example me-2"></i>
